---
import {RFP_STEPS} from '../../lib/rfp-metrics';
interface Props {evidence:readonly unknown[]}
const ga4=Astro.props.evidence.find((v:any)=>v?.id==='ga4') as any;
const rfp=ga4?.rfp;
const safe=(v:unknown):number|null=>typeof v==='number'&&Number.isSafeInteger(v)&&v>=0?v:null;
const current=safe(rfp?.current?.count),previous=safe(rfp?.previous?.count);
const measuredSteps=Array.isArray(rfp?.funnel?.steps)?rfp.funnel.steps:[];
const steps=RFP_STEPS.map(([event,label])=>({event,label,users:safe(measuredSteps.find((s:any)=>s?.event===event)?.users)}));
const channels=Array.isArray(rfp?.channels?.rows)?rfp.channels.rows.filter((r:any)=>typeof r?.channel==='string'&&safe(r?.count)!==null):null;
const base=steps[0].users;
const fmt=(v:number|null)=>v===null?'—':new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US').format(v);
const pct=(value:number|null,total:number|null)=>value!==null&&total!==null&&total>0?(value/total*100).toFixed(1)+'%':'—';
const thresholded=rfp?.funnel?.metadata?.subjectToThresholding===true;
const sampled=!!rfp?.funnel?.metadata?.samplingMetadatas?.length;
---
<section class="rfp" aria-labelledby="rfp-title">
 <header><div><p class="a-label a-muted">Primary website goal</p><h2 id="rfp-title">Proposal requests</h2><p class="a-muted">Follow the path from a visit to a saved request.</p></div><div class="rfp-total"><strong>{fmt(current)}</strong><span>submissions · previous 28 days: {fmt(previous)}</span></div></header>
 {rfp?.period?<p class="a-count">{rfp.period.startDate} → {rfp.period.endDate} · {rfp.timeZone} · GA4, ZINC hosts · submission comparison</p>:<p class="a-count">Refresh site checks to load proposal submissions and funnel evidence.</p>}
 {Array.isArray(rfp?.gaps)&&rfp.gaps.length>0&&<p class="a-count">{rfp.gaps.filter((v:unknown)=>typeof v==='string').join(' ')}</p>}
 {rfp?.funnelPeriod?<p class="a-count">Funnel: {rfp.funnelPeriod.startDate} → {rfp.funnelPeriod.endDate} · {rfp.timeZone} · fully instrumented days only</p>:<p class="a-count">Funnel measurement awaits complete days of form tracking, starting November 5, 2026. Earlier visitors are excluded from its denominator.</p>}
 <div class="rfp-table"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Ordered stage</th><th scope="col">Users</th><th scope="col">Of site visitors</th><th scope="col">From prior stage</th></tr></thead><tbody>{steps.map((step,i)=><tr><th scope="row"><span class="rfp-order">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span>{step.label}<span class="rfp-track" aria-hidden="true">{step.users!==null&&base!==null&&base>0&&<i style={`width:${Math.min(100,step.users/base*100)}%`}/>}</span></th><td data-label="Users">{fmt(step.users)}</td><td data-label="Of visitors">{pct(step.users,base)}</td><td data-label="Prior stage">{i?pct(step.users,steps[i-1].users):'—'}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
 <p class="a-count">The funnel counts users who complete these steps in order during the stated funnel period; other actions may occur between steps. Submissions count saved-request events, including requests outside that sequence. These counts have different denominators.</p>
 {channels&&<div class="rfp-channels"><h3>Submissions by acquisition channel</h3>{channels.length?<ul>{channels.map((r:any)=><li><span>{r.channel}</span><strong>{fmt(r.count)}</strong></li>)}</ul>:<p class="a-count">No submission channel rows returned for this period.</p>}<p class="a-count">GA4 session channel attribution · up to 50 returned channels. Unassigned traffic remains visible.</p></div>}
 <details><summary class="a-count">Coverage and goal definitions</summary><p class="a-count">Form-step measurement begins with the November 4, 2026 release. Earlier missing stages are unavailable, not measured drop-off. Consent and tracking blockers can reduce coverage. Only a successful saved request emits <code>generate_lead</code>; button clicks and thank-you-page views are not conversions. Qualification, proposals, wins and collected revenue require the planned CRM and Square connection.</p>{(sampled||thresholded)&&<p class="a-count">Google reports {sampled?'sampling':''}{sampled&&thresholded?' and ':''}{thresholded?'privacy thresholding':''} for this funnel.</p>}</details>
</section>
<style>
.rfp{padding:28px 0;border-block:1px solid var(--line);margin:28px 0}.rfp header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}.rfp h2{font:800 25px var(--font-display),sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:5px 0}.rfp header p{margin:6px 0}.rfp-total{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;max-width:270px}.rfp-total strong{font:800 48px var(--font-display),sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;line-height:1}.rfp-total span{font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted)}.rfp-table{overflow:auto;margin:22px 0}.rfp table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px}.rfp th,.rfp td{text-align:right;padding:15px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.rfp thead th{font:11px var(--font-mono),monospace;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.04em}.rfp th:first-child{text-align:left;min-width:240px;width:52%;padding-left:0}.rfp tbody th{font-weight:500;position:relative}.rfp-order{font:11px var(--font-mono),monospace;color:var(--muted);margin-right:15px}.rfp-track{display:block;margin:10px 0 0 31px;height:4px;background:var(--line);max-width:380px}.rfp-track i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--tealt)}.rfp p.a-count{line-height:1.7;max-width:100ch}.rfp-channels{margin:22px 0}.rfp-channels h3{font:700 16px var(--font-display),sans-serif}.rfp-channels ul{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px 32px;list-style:none;padding:0}.rfp-channels li{display:flex;gap:20px;font-size:14px}.rfp-channels strong{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.rfp summary{cursor:pointer}.rfp code{font-family:var(--font-mono)}@media(max-width:760px){.rfp header{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.rfp table,.rfp tbody{display:block;width:100%}.rfp thead{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip-path:inset(50%)}.rfp tbody tr{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:8px 0}.rfp tbody th{grid-column:1/-1;min-width:0;width:auto;border:0;padding-bottom:4px}.rfp td{text-align:left;border:0;padding:10px 8px 12px 0}.rfp td:before{content:attr(data-label);display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;margin-bottom:7px}.rfp-track{max-width:none}.rfp-total strong{font-size:40px}.rfp-total{max-width:none}}
</style>
